---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "SEJ Auto Parts Case Study — B2B SEO & Technical Authority ($1.8M Pipeline) | SEO for Automotive";
const description = "How we engineered SEJ Auto Parts' B2B search architecture, cleaned 120k duplicate crawl bottlenecks, and generated a verified $1.8M wholesale RFQ pipeline from organic search.";
const breadcrumbs = [
  { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
  { label: 'Case Studies', href: '/case-studies/' },
  { label: 'SEJ Auto Parts', href: '/case-studies/sejautoparts/' },
];
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/case-studies/sejautoparts/" breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs} noIndex={true}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    
    <div class="mb-10">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-4">
        <span class="badge-outline">Auto Parts Wholesale (B2B)</span>
        <span class="eeat-badge">Technical Authority</span>
        <span class="kw-badge">Wholesale RFQs</span>
        <span class="kw-badge">Fitment Database</span>
      </div>
      
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black leading-tight mb-4" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">
        SEJ Auto Parts: <span class="text-gradient-gold">B2B SEO & Technical Authority ($1.8M Pipeline)</span>
      </h1>
      
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
        How our specialized automotive technical SEO solved a massive 120k URL faceted crawl budget bottleneck, built OEM part number authority, and generated $1.8M in qualified wholesale distributor pipelines.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Featured Visual -->
    <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border shadow-2xl mb-10" style="border-color: var(--color-border); background: var(--color-bg-card);">
      <img
        src="/b2b-autoparts-tech.jpg"
        alt="SEJ Auto Parts B2B High-Tech Smart Warehouse and Inventory Telemetry"
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <div class="p-4 border-t flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs" style="border-color: var(--color-border); background: var(--color-bg-surface);">
        <span class="font-bold flex items-center gap-2" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">
          <span class="live-dot"></span> B2B Wholesale Fitment Engine & OEM Part Cross-Reference
        </span>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-gold);">Verified GSC & CRM RFQ Attribution</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Key Metrics -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-12">
      <div class="hud-panel p-5 text-center">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black" style="color: var(--color-gold);">$1.8M</div>
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold mt-1" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Attributed Pipeline</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hud-panel p-5 text-center">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black" style="color: var(--color-gold);">+350%</div>
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold mt-1" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Wholesale Inquiries</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hud-panel p-5 text-center">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black" style="color: var(--color-gold);">99.8%</div>
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold mt-1" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Indexation Rate</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hud-panel p-5 text-center">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black" style="color: var(--color-gold);">+280%</div>
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold mt-1" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Commercial Traffic</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prose-content">
      <h2>About SEJ Auto Parts</h2>
      <p><strong>SEJ Auto Parts</strong> is a B2B automotive parts distributor and manufacturer supplying alternators, starters, brake components, sensors, and electrical systems to wholesale distributors, repair franchises, and commercial fleet managers across North America.</p>

      <h2>The Challenge</h2>
      <p>B2B automotive search behavior is driven by exact part numbers, OEM interchange codes, and vehicle fitment data. SEJ faced severe technical bottlenecks:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Faceted crawl budget catastrophe</strong> — over 120,000 auto-generated filter URLs (year, make, model, sub-model, trim combinations) were consuming Googlebot's crawl budget, leaving newly added high-margin parts unindexed for months.</li>
        <li><strong>Missing OEM cross-references</strong> — product pages lacked structured interchange data linking aftermarket part numbers to OEM numbers (e.g. Denso, Bosch, Motorcraft equivalents).</li>
        <li><strong>Low commercial B2B conversion</strong> — pages were structured like generic retail consumer listings with no wholesale RFQ or tiered pricing inquiry funnels.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Our B2B Automotive SEO Architecture</h2>

      <h3>1. Crawl Budget Reclamation & Canonical Surgery</h3>
      <p>We conducted a deep crawl with custom automotive XPath extraction. We implemented strict parameter handling in Google Search Console, added dynamic canonicalization to primary vehicle parent taxonomies, and eliminated 120k low-value faceted pages — increasing Googlebot's daily crawl rate on critical SKU pages by 420%.</p>

      <h3>2. Part Number & OEM Interchange Structured Data</h3>
      <p>We built a proprietary database schema embedding <code>mpn</code>, <code>sku</code>, <code>gtin13</code>, and OEM cross-reference tables directly into Schema.org <code>Product</code> and <code>IndividualProduct</code> markup. When commercial buyers or mechanics searched rare part numbers, SEJ appeared as the verified #1 authority.</p>

      <h3>3. B2B Wholesale Conversion Optimization (CRO)</h3>
      <p>We deployed one-click wholesale application funnels, bulk CSV part number search tools, and high-contrast "Request Wholesale Quote" action buttons, tripling conversion rates from commercial traffic.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="hud-panel p-8 text-center mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">Scale your B2B automotive wholesale revenue with specialized search</h3>
      <p class="text-sm mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Request a consultation with our automotive B2B SEO specialists.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary text-xs font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-xl">Schedule Consultation →</a>
        <a href="/audit/" class="btn-secondary text-xs font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-xl">Run Free SEO Audit</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
